{{Short description|Literature written in or related to the United States}}
{{redirect-multi|1|American fiction|other uses|American Fiction (disambiguation)|and|American literature (disambiguation)}}
{{Use American English|date=May 2015}}
{{Use mdy dates|date=May 2015}}
