| footer            = {{center|'''Clockwise from top left:'''}} The 19th-century writer and humorist [[Mark Twain]]; the 19th-century writer, poet and literary critic [[Edgar Allan Poe]]; the 20th-century writer and novelist [[John Steinbeck]]; the novelist [[Toni Morrison]]; the 20th-century writer and poet [[Louise Glück]]; the 20th-century writer and novelist [[Ernest Hemingway]];
